{"unit_id":"ethanwong-hk__dsh-thinking-guard#card-zh","repo":"ethanwong-hk/dsh-thinking-guard","commit":"1e3440d96525806a7cf8908e4c00f6f847eadd23","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-thinking-guard 是面向 DSH agent 回合的思考空转熔断插件，挂接全局 assistant stream 事件并跟踪每个会话的回合状态。它会在持续只有 reasoning、没有文本或工具调用时按时限中止，也会限制单次推理字符数，并检测精确短语、句子模板、稀疏短句和 N-gram 重复循环。触发后取消当前活动，尽力注入说明，并可自动提示继续任务。适合希望避免 agent 长时间思考却不推进工作的 DSH 用户；不需要额外账号或 API key，可通过补丁配置阈值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-339","lib/index.js:342-432"]}
{"unit_id":"ethanwong-hk__dsh-thinking-guard#card-en","repo":"ethanwong-hk/dsh-thinking-guard","commit":"1e3440d96525806a7cf8908e4c00f6f847eadd23","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-thinking-guard prevents DSH agent turns from stalling. It watches assistant-stream events and cancels when reasoning exceeds a time or character limit, or repeats phrases. It can explain the interruption and prompt the agent to continue. Thresholds are configurable; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-339","lib/index.js:342-432"]}
