{"unit_id":"ethanwong-hk__dsh-thinking-guard#feature-1","repo":"ethanwong-hk/dsh-thinking-guard","commit":"1e3440d96525806a7cf8908e4c00f6f847eadd23","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-thinking-guard 的功能「纯思考超时」：当 reasoning 持续产生但没有回复文本或工具调用，并超过配置时限时，插件取消当前 agent 活动。时限可通过 thinkingOnlyMs 调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:323-330"]}
